<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100311" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεπίσταμαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be privy to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἐπανάστασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					5.4.19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπιστότατον ἔργον ς. μοι πεποιηκότι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gorg.
					<u>Pal.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τινὶ πονηρὰ δράσαντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Cat.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				27
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν ἐμαυτῷ ψεῦδος εἰπόντι
			ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>VH</u>
				2.31
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cal.</u>
				9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἃ ἐμαυτῷ συνεπίσταμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Jb.</u>
					19.27
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>know perfectly well</i> or <i>fully</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλάκις ἑώρακα . . τὸν ἥλιον καὶ
					σελήνην δρῶντας ταῦθ᾽ ἃ ἀεὶ πάντες συνεπιστάμεθα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					821c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἄρα συνεπίστανται ὅτι
				ἐπίστανται</span>; <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>SE</u>
				177a27
			</span></i>.</div>
